1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,940
Six years, and you still count the bars.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:04,500
Twenty-two.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:05,680
Same as yesterday.

4
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:08,320
Give me your hand.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,440
Twenty-four words.

6
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:12,280
Learn them.

7
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:13,580
Then wash them off.

8
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:14,340
What are they?

9
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,047
Eleven million dollars.

10
00:00:18,047 --> 00:00:19,600
Nobody knows it exists.

11
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,420
Spend it on a life, Edie.

12
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:22,380
Not on them.

13
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,100
Ivo?

14
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:25,580
Ivo.

15
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:30,100
My old firm.

16
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:30,860
For sale.

17
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:35,240
Buy it.
